"text": "- **No smoke, no live leg, no self-verify.** Nothing here is a boot-path or a UI surface: the modify-set is one   stdlib script and chunk-folder documents. - **Rust gates defer.** `cargo nextest` and `cargo clippy` carry `defer`: zero `.rs` delta, and no uncommitted file   a Rust test reads. /implement re-verifies that through `gate.py delta --defer-check rust`, and the entries run if   the delta says otherwise. No capability is claimed (§Verification ledger), so P5 leaves   `verification-matrix.json` unwritten and `matrix_ledger_gate` has no new input. - **No frontend gate.** No TS delta. - **Pre-commit scope.** The `--rev HEAD` entries read HEAD as the pre-compaction tree. That holds at /implement   and at the wrap P7 light gate, which runs before the commit. It is not true afterwards, and nothing re-runs   these entries afterwards."
}
